      <definition>[= ylede-, ylde-, 1.] v.i. To be left over; to be superfluous; to remain, survive.</definition>
      <page>1004</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠥᠯᠠᠭᠰᠡᠨ ᠢᠳᠡᠭᠡᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--gsen idegen</transcript>
          <definition> Leftover food.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠴᠦᠰ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ ᠨᠢᠭᠡᠨ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠥᠯᠠᠺᠥ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>ecys tyr nigen ber --ky ygei</transcript>
          <definition> Finally not even one will remain.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
